<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- A chip in the Calendar widget's month (Nov 2026), as the Home calendar's
     marks: filled is an event (faded, something finished), outlined a task,
     dashed a release. White; the cell tints each to its colour. -->
